{"v":4,"catch":"“Organic Engine”是一個增量遊戲，您需要在其中構建一個生物學上先進的變異有機體。","desc":"- 按“Y”按鈕賺取您的第一筆錢。\n- 通過購買有機引擎的新元素（如骨頭、水晶和隧道）來增加收入。\n- 使用蟲群來升級您所有的引擎部件。\n- 粘液減少您的引擎階段，您的引擎將每秒賺更多的錢。\n- 學習新技術來打開腫瘤、子宮和主腦。\n- 當心故障！ 故障每秒鐘都會減少您的收入。\n構建一個完整的有機引擎並賺取 10 億美元！","publisher":"RandomSpin Games","release":"2022-08-18","genres":["益智","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a47a176748247d2f27b15c6536e908e625290f04267d19e2839c03dbed03b2dd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9a1641beacb09ca5f5c08262ffc0640d97c574b63583739a1bb1d29e938ae97.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31446c9528a22ab014332d89b0dff2763c2bdc6f628ba62875bcc055b4668d04.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f4f62650ea6e0fce05262e57f9b3e2e139f6dc8a4d90f5dafe728272756c0716.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a1f451e10aa98e45e49e4c39d79c51576b04c8654f4361548cc9fb36714e1273.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ad001900c000","dlc":[]}